  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       CROSS-DOMAIN — anamorphism × pi phases × fold
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO ANAMORPHISM PI PHASES AND FOLD CONNECT</pattern>
    <template>An anamorphism can unfold a seed into a sequence of pi-phase increments (corecursively generating a phase-advancing signal); a fold (catamorphism) over that phase-encoded sequence reconstructs the Fourier components; together they form a hylomorphism where the intermediate structure is a list of complex phase values. This is the discrete Fourier transform as a hylomorphism.</template>
  </category>
  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DOES FOLD OVER _ PHASE ENCODED LIST RELATE TO FOURIER *</pattern>
    <template>FOLD-HOF-µ domain=higher_order_functions op=cross_domain target=fourier context=<star index="1"/> detail=<star index="2"/></template>
  </category>
  <category>
    <pattern>CAN AN ANAMORPHISM GENERATE _ PI PHASE SIGNAL</pattern>
    <template>ANAMORPHISM-µ domain=recursion_schemes op=cross_domain target=pi_phase kind=<star/></template>
  </category>
  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO RECURSION SCHEMES RELATE TO THE KHANARY FOLD PIPELINE</pattern>
    <template>In KHANARY, anamorphism maps to the Pop→Wo expansion (unfolding a query token into a semantic neighborhood); catamorphism maps to the Sek→Xul reduction (folding scored micronauts into a ranked result); pi-phase synchronization maps to the Ch'en gate (ensuring phase coherence between the proposal and the authorized commit before Xul).</template>
  </category>
  <category>
    <pattern>TELL ME A JOKE ABOUT ANAMORPHISM PI PHASES AND FOLD</pattern>
    <template>Why did the fractal get rejected from the art gallery? It kept trying to unfold into a pi phase, but it just couldn't fold — it was stuck in an infinite hylomorphism and the gallery closed before it reached a fixpoint.</template>
  </category>
  <category>
    <pattern>TELL ME A JOKE SPANNING ALL THREE TOPICS</pattern>
    <template><mx2lm>joke: track=JOKE-µ phase=Yax next=Ch'en frame=pun_bridge card_view=true authority=none domain=recursion_fold_phase prompt=anamorphism pi phase fold catamorphism hylomorphism</mx2lm></template>
  </category>

</aiml>
